<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Blog</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .blog {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #15803d;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            border: 2px solid #555;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px gray;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        input,
        textarea,
        select {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #777;
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #1e3a8a;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #15803d;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="blog">

        <h1>My Personal Blog</h1>

        <h2>My First Blog Post</h2>

        <p>
            Welcome to my personal blog. This is my first blog post
            where I share my thoughts and experiences.
        </p>

        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSTPbCkVCLk39eusN1TZ_iVFcCOl9X6GQXeVVzdprHHtvO8T8dtXYP2ldsC&s=10" alt="Japan Image">

        <h2>Learning HTML and CSS</h2>

        <p>
            HTML helps me create the structure of a website,
            while CSS helps me design and style it. Learning
            web development is fun and useful.
        </p>

        <h2>My Hobbies</h2>

        <p>
            During my free time, I enjoy watching movies,
            playing games, listening to music, and learning
            new things about computers.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="form">

        <h2>Feedback Form</h2>

        <form>

            <label>Name:</label>
            <input type="text" required>

            <label>Email:</label>
            <input type="email" required>

            <label>Comments:</label>
            <textarea rows="5" required></textarea>

            <button type="submit">Submit</button>

        </form>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
